    "name": "Microsoft Windows 10 Windows Ink API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "API for pen and stylus input in Windows applications, based on the Windows.UI.Input.Inking namespace. Provides inking surfaces (InkCanvas, InkPresenter), stroke management (InkStroke, InkStrokeBuilder), ink recognition (InkRecognizer, InkAnalyzer), and handwriting analysis. Supports pressure sensitivity, tilt, and barrel button interactions.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Developer Support",
